# The build context of the Containerfile. Build outputs, local state and the web workspace's
# installed packages stay out; the stages install and build what they need.
.git
# The worktrees and state of local development sessions: never part of the image, and with their tool
# binaries large enough to fill the build VM's disk.
.claude
.github
.out
.bin
.dev
bin
quader
node_modules
**/node_modules
web/dist
web/.angular
web/coverage
# The embedded UI is built by the web stage; a locale directory left over from a local build is not
# copied in. Docker cleans a trailing slash off a pattern, so "dist/*/" would leave out every file of the
# folder: the committed files are named back in (the package's embed.go and the placeholders).
internal/webui/dist/*
!internal/webui/dist/embed.go
!internal/webui/dist/index.html
internal/bastion/gui/dist/*
!internal/bastion/gui/dist/index.html
